// ── TRAMPS & WALLS (graduated coins): individual small elements, sized by $ (log), compact $ tag.
//    React pushes window.__trampWalls [{id,kind:'tramp'|'wall',mcap,lo,hi,sizeUsd,mine,status}] + window.__twPreview.
